    {
      "text": "Lehi1 sees God sitting upon throne, 1 Ne. 1:8. heavens are God’s throne, 1 Ne. 17:39 (3 Ne. 12:34; Matt. 5:34). Isaiah1 sees God sitting upon throne, 2 Ne. 16:1 (Isa. 6:1). Lucifer would exalt his throne above stars of God, 2 Ne. 24:13 (Isa. 14:13). spirits of wicked must stand before throne of God to be judged, 2 Ne. 28:23. Lamanites’ skins may be whiter than Nephites’ when brought before throne of God, Jacob 3:8. Nephites swear by throne of God they will defeat enemies, Morm. 3:10. God’s throne is high in heavens, Moro. 9:26.",
